{"task":"transcribe","language":"en","duration":61.0466875,"text":"A CEO, a COO, a CMO, a sales rep, a developer, and a data analyst all running my business as I'm filming this reel. This is a complete operating system. Every agent has their own role, their own tasks, and their own context from the rest of the business. My COO pulls competitor in market context. My CMO turns that into content briefs. My sales rep checks leads and follow-up opportunities. My data analyst watches performance, my developer improves my workflows, and then my CEO decides what needs attention first and then makes the decisions. But the most important part is the shared memory system. When one agent learns something, the whole system can then use it instead of starting from zero every single time. This is what it means by replacing manual business operations with an autonomous, self-improving AI agent system. If you want me to show you the complete structure breakdown, comment system down below.","words":null,"segments":[{"avg_logprob":-0.10313108556649901,"compression_ratio":1.6291666666666667,"end":7.64,"id":1,"no_speech_prob":0.04330598935484886,"seek":0,"start":0.0,"temperature":0.0,"text":" A CEO, a COO, a CMO, a sales rep, a developer, and a data analyst all running my business","tokens":[50364,316,9282,11,257,3002,46,11,257,383,18976,11,257,5763,1085,11,257,10754,11,293,257,1412,19085,439,2614,452,1606,50746],"words":null},{"avg_logprob":-0.10313108556649901,"compression_ratio":1.6291666666666667,"end":9.72,"id":2,"no_speech_prob":0.04330598935484886,"seek":0,"start":7.64,"temperature":0.0,"text":" as I'm filming this reel.","tokens":[50746,382,286,478,8869,341,34973,13,50850],"words":null},{"avg_logprob":-0.10313108556649901,"compression_ratio":1.6291666666666667,"end":12.16,"id":3,"no_speech_prob":0.04330598935484886,"seek":0,"start":9.72,"temperature":0.0,"text":" This is a complete operating system.","tokens":[50850,639,307,257,3566,7447,1185,13,50972],"words":null},{"avg_logpro